                            <comment id="17265090" author="reamer" created="Thu, 14 Jan 2021 18:03:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;You can find a working image at PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4022&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4022&lt;/a&gt;. Unfortunately, I cannot test this image because I use a customisation image of zeppelin-server and zepperlin-interpreter in K8s.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
